  "instructions": [
    "heat the mangalitsa lard in a large skillet over medium-high heat.",
    "add the shio-cure pork belly and cook for 2-3 minutes on each side, or until crispy.",
    "add the mushroom duxelles and cook until fragrant, about 1 minute.",
    "add the sumac, gruyere cheese, scotch bonnet pepper, cilantro, lime juice, honey, kosher salt, black pepper, and cayenne pepper. stir to combine.",
    "wrap the mixture in the flour tortilla and cook for an additional 2-3 minutes, or until the cheese is melted and the tortilla is crispy.",
    "sprinkle with coconut flour and serve immediately."
